"""Publish the independently recounted frozen-checkpoint diagnosis in both languages."""
import hashlib,json
from pathlib import Path
HERE=Path(__file__).resolve().parent
def sha(p):return hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest()
def main():
    path=HERE/'results/collapse_diagnostic.json';z=json.loads(path.read_text());a=json.loads((HERE/'results/collapse_diagnostic_audit.json').read_text());assert a['status']=='passed' and a['source_report_sha256']==sha(path) and a['auditor_sha256']==sha(HERE/'audit_collapse_diagnostic.py')
    s=z['training_label_statistics']
    for lang in ['en','zh']:
        text=('# v0.31: why the first new adapter returned empty prescriptions\n\n' if lang=='en' else '# v0.31：首个新适配器为何全部输出空处方\n\n')
        text+=('## Directly observed failure\n\nThe first seed42 permuted-uniform update completes 100 optimizer steps. All 100 proposal admissions under both ranked and permuted presentation produce the same valid all-zero mask: **200/200 empty prescriptions, drug/order micro-F1=0**. Removing the empty reasoning wrapper does not change any decision. This is a semantic prediction failure, not failed JSON parsing. The promotion rule rejects this adapter and retains the base model.\n\n' if lang=='en' else '## 直接观察到的失败\n\nseed42随机位置普通更新完成100个优化步骤后，100例proposal在原排序与打乱排序下都生成同一条合法全零选择列表：**200/200条空处方，药物／订单micro-F1=0**。删除空的思考标签不会改变选择结果。这是预测内容失败，不是JSON解析失败。升级规则已拒绝该适配器，保留基础模型。\n\n')
        text+=(f"The actual 400 training sequences contain **{s['positive_slots']}/{s['total_slots']} positive decisions ({100*s['prevalence']:.2f}%)**; {s['zero_target_examples']}/400 have no reachable target drug. The 69-token completion includes only 20 binary decisions; the remaining tokens encode syntax and the template. Constant decisions can therefore coexist with a low overall language-model loss. These observations motivate, but alone do not prove, an imbalance explanation.\n\n" if lang=='en' else f"真实400条训练序列中，仅 **{s['positive_slots']}/{s['total_slots']}个位置为正例（{100*s['prevalence']:.2f}%）**，其中{s['zero_target_examples']}/400条没有候选集合内的真值药物。69个回答token中只有20个为二元决策，其余为语法和模板；因此总体语言模型损失较低仍可能对应恒定选择。这些观察支持检查类别不平衡，但单凭比例不能证明原因。\n\n")
        text+=('## Frozen-checkpoint probability diagnosis\n\nBefore further inference, the diagnostic fixed the first 32 training examples and first 32 proposal cases in both views, comparing the frozen base and failed adapter. At each of 20 decision positions it measures P(1 | token is 0 or 1). **Zero-prefix** scoring supplies zeros at earlier decision positions without looking at labels. **GT-prefix** scoring supplies earlier ground-truth decisions and is an oracle diagnostic, not deployable accuracy. No threshold is selected, no model is refit, and no guard/test prediction is generated.\n\n' if lang=='en' else '## 冻结模型后的概率诊断\n\n追加推理前固定前32条训练样本及前32例proposal的两种排序，对比基础模型与失败适配器。在20个决策位置分别测量P(1｜token属于0或1)。**全零前缀**在先前位置填0，不使用真值；**真值前缀**输入先前位置的真实选择，仅是oracle诊断，不是可部署准确率。没有选择新阈值、重新训练模型或生成guard／测试预测。\n\n')
        text+='| State | Cases/view | Prefix | Conditional BCE ↓ | AUROC ↑ | Mean P(1), positive / negative | P(1) ≥ 0.5 (%) |\n|---|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n'
        for state,groups in z['states'].items():
            for group,contexts in groups.items():
                for context,r in contexts.items():
                    prefix='GT' if context.startswith('teacher') else 'zero';text+=f"| {state} | {group} | {prefix} | {r['conditional_binary_bce']:.4f} | {r['auroc']:.4f} | {r['mean_probability_given_positive']:.4f} / {r['mean_probability_given_negative']:.4f} | {100*r['fraction_at_or_above_half']:.2f} |\n"
        text+=('\n## Interpretation and next intervention\n\nCompare conditional discrimination and probability calibration separately from greedy generation. Low probability for every positive decision can yield empty generation even when rankings retain signal. Near-chance AUROC would instead indicate little useful conditional discrimination in this diagnostic. Neither outcome proves human-like prescribing or a distinct RSI benefit.\n\nThe next repair should explicitly supervise drug decisions, separate syntax tokens from decision loss, and test probability calibration against unmodified greedy decoding. It must keep no-feedback, uniform-update and shuffled-feedback controls at the same update budget. Register any such intervention before fitting, retain the failed checkpoint, select settings on development data, and freeze them before evaluating generalization. This diagnostic does not retrospectively replace the original v31 outputs.\n\n' if lang=='en' else '\n## 解释与下一项修复\n\n需要分别看决策区分能力、概率校准和贪心生成：即便概率排序有信号，所有正例概率偏低也会使生成结果全零；如果AUROC接近随机，则说明当前诊断中缺少有用的条件区分能力。两者都不能证明已学会人类处方思路或RSI具有独特收益。\n\n下一项修复应明确监督药物决策，将语法token和决策损失分开，并把概率校准与原贪心解码直接对照；保持无反馈、普通更新和打乱反馈的同预算控制。任何新增干预都应先登记后拟合，保留失败检查点，在开发集选定设置并冻结后再评估泛化。本诊断不替换原v31结果。\n\n')
        text+=('## Evidence and limits\n\nThe independent recount reconstructs source targets and recomputes all saved-probability metrics with a separate implementation. Neural forward passes were not independently rerun. The sample is small, deterministic and selected by file order after an observed failure; this is a mechanism diagnostic, not a new test result.\n\n' if lang=='en' else '## 证据与局限\n\n独立核验重建了源标签，并用另一套实现复算保存概率的全部指标；没有独立重跑神经网络前向计算。样本较小、按文件顺序确定，问题也来自已观察到的失败，因此属于机制诊断，不是新测试成绩。\n\n')
        text+='[Registered diagnostic](collapse_diagnostic_protocol.json) · [Aggregate results](results/collapse_diagnostic.json) · [Independent recount](results/collapse_diagnostic_audit.json)\n'
        (HERE/f'COLLAPSE.{lang}.md').write_text(text)
if __name__=='__main__':main()
